    "text": "Wind speed can increase up to (60-65) kmph at times in the deep and shallow sea areas extending from Colombo to Mullaitivu via Galle, Matara, Hambanthota, Pottuvil and Batticaloa. Wind speed can increase up to 50 kmph at times in the other sea areas around the island. State of Sea: The deep and shallow sea areas extending from Colombo to Mullaitivu via Galle, Matara, Hambanthota, Pottuvil and Batticaloa will be very rough at times. Other sea areas around the island may be rough at times.",
